---
// src/components/ChangelogSection.astro
---

<section id="changelog" class="space-y-6 pt-8 border-t border-border">
  <div class="space-y-2 text-center max-w-2xl mx-auto">
    <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold bg-emerald-500/10 text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400 border border-emerald-500/20">
      <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-500 animate-pulse"></span>
      Portal Rules &amp; Engine Changelog
    </div>
    <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-foreground">
      Verified Guidelines &amp; Update History
    </h2>
    <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">
      Track verified changes to Indian recruitment portal specifications, browser canvas optimizations, and document validation rules.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto space-y-4">
    <!-- Log 1: Feb 2026 -->
    <div class="p-4 sm:p-5 rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card shadow-xs space-y-3">
      <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-2 border-b border-border/60 pb-2.5">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
          <span class="px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-md text-[11px] font-mono font-bold bg-primary/10 text-primary border border-primary/20">
            v2026.2.4
          </span>
          <h3 class="text-sm font-bold text-foreground">SSC 2026 OTR Portal Specification Alignment</h3>
        </div>
        <span class="text-[11px] font-mono text-muted-foreground">Updated: February 2026</span>
      </div>
      <p class="text-xs text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">
        Validated against the latest Staff Selection Commission (SSC CGL / CHSL / MTS) portal guidelines. Enforces strict 140×60 px (4.0 cm × 2.0 cm) dimensions and automated dual-boundary 10 KB to 20 KB compression to eliminate applicant disqualification.
      </p>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 pt-1 text-[11px]">
        <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-muted/60 text-foreground/80 font-medium">SSC CGL / CHSL</span>
        <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-muted/60 text-foreground/80 font-medium">10–20 KB Floor Guard</span>
        <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-muted/60 text-foreground/80 font-medium">140×60 px Preset</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Log 2: Jan 2026 -->
    <div class="p-4 sm:p-5 rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card shadow-xs space-y-3">
      <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-2 border-b border-border/60 pb-2.5">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
          <span class="px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-md text-[11px] font-mono font-bold bg-primary/10 text-primary border border-primary/20">
            v2026.1.8
          </span>
          <h3 class="text-sm font-bold text-foreground">UPSC CSE &amp; CDS 20 KB Floor Rule Guard</h3>
        </div>
        <span class="text-[11px] font-mono text-muted-foreground">Updated: January 2026</span>
      </div>
      <p class="text-xs text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">
        Added precision quantization floor enforcement to resolve the common <em class="text-foreground">"Signature size should be at least 20kb"</em> error on the UPSC Online Application Portal (upsconline.nic.in). Guarantees output stays above 20 KB while capping under 300 KB.
      </p>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 pt-1 text-[11px]">
        <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-muted/60 text-foreground/80 font-medium">UPSC Civil Services / NDA</span>
        <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-muted/60 text-foreground/80 font-medium">20 KB Minimum Limit Guard</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Log 3: Jan 2026 -->
    <div class="p-4 sm:p-5 rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card shadow-xs space-y-3">
      <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-2 border-b border-border/60 pb-2.5">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
          <span class="px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-md text-[11px] font-mono font-bold bg-primary/10 text-primary border border-primary/20">
            v2026.1.2
          </span>
          <h3 class="text-sm font-bold text-foreground">Clean White Paper 3.0 (Dynamic Shadow Remover)</h3>
        </div>
        <span class="text-[11px] font-mono text-muted-foreground">Updated: January 2026</span>
      </div>
      <p class="text-xs text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">
        Upgraded client-side thresholding algorithm for mobile photos taken under low or yellowish indoor lighting. Isolates dark ink strokes and dynamically whitens grayish paper backgrounds to crisp #FFFFFF without degrading handwritten fine lines.
      </p>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 pt-1 text-[11px]">
        <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-muted/60 text-foreground/80 font-medium">Mobile Camera Photos</span>
        <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-muted/60 text-foreground/80 font-medium">Zero-Upload Privacy</span>
        <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-muted/60 text-foreground/80 font-medium">Shadow Bleach</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Log 4: Dec 2025 -->
    <div class="p-4 sm:p-5 rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card shadow-xs space-y-3">
      <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-2 border-b border-border/60 pb-2.5">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
          <span class="px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-md text-[11px] font-mono font-bold bg-primary/10 text-primary border border-primary/20">
            v2025.12.0
          </span>
          <h3 class="text-sm font-bold text-foreground">PAN Card NSDL &amp; UTIITSL 200 DPI Profile</h3>
        </div>
        <span class="text-[11px] font-mono text-muted-foreground">Updated: December 2025</span>
      </div>
      <p class="text-xs text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">
        Aligned aspect ratio lock (4.5 cm × 2.0 cm) and DPI conversion formulas with the NSDL Protean and UTIITSL form 49A requirements, maintaining file sizes under 50 KB.
      </p>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 pt-1 text-[11px]">
        <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-muted/60 text-foreground/80 font-medium">PAN Card 49A/49AA</span>
        <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-muted/60 text-foreground/80 font-medium">200 DPI Physical Standard</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
